{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:39 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:39 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:39 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"尖沙咀保時捷行車不穩遇查 車內檢獲懷疑大麻 36歲男司機涉多罪被捕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6d2eb1b922ffecde84f4bf2adcd822c1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_59_2_.jpeg\"/><p>尖沙咀發生藥駕案。今日（18日）晚上10時02分，西九龍總區交通部人員巡經碧仙桃路與麼地道交界時，發現一輛私家車懷疑行車不穩，遂上前截查，並在車內檢獲半枝懷疑大麻。</p><p>經初步調查，36歲姓莊男司機未能通過快速口腔液測試，涉嫌藥後駕駛、管有危險藥物及外出時沒有攜帶身份證明文件被捕。男司機其後被送往伊利沙伯醫院接受檢查。</p><img alt=\"保時捷男司機當場被捕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9cec6b91e16f4c764cd46fc2255f7cb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"保時捷男司機當場被捕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0eb7c1d00b2cff82a829be24c16e431e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"西九龍交通部人員在碧仙桃道截查一輛可疑私家車，車上搜出懷疑大麻。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e2e919f8303bde8c158e151b318afe8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"緝毒太奉召到場協助搜車。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fbaca9cfb99b03d39f05cec7e635f38/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"緝毒太奉召到場協助搜車。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03948bbb3c12eb61dea3adac6bd9adc2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_59.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，涉事的為一輛保時捷私家車。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T19:39:01.179065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:39:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T01:17:46.695909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T19:37:40.038594+00:00","content_hash":"217ca940f1a933ef073767c9dccaebec084a8e2e527fc1cd9fedd35e65c171fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}